      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Maribyrnong, VIC**, here are a few well-reviewed locksmiths that install digital and smart locks:\n\n- Maribyrnong Locksmiths – Local mobile locksmith offering digital/smart lock installation, rekeying, and residential locksmith services. Their website notes they provide fixed quotes and a 1-year warranty on supplied parts and workmanship. [www.maribyrnonglocksmiths.com.au](https://www.maribyrnonglocksmiths.com.au/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n- Lock, Smith and Barrel – 24/7 emergency locksmith based in nearby West Footscray with strong customer reviews.\n- Onpoint Locksmith – Footscray-based locksmith offering residential lock installations.\n- TLC Security Locksmiths – Well-reviewed locksmith servicing Melbourne's inner west, including smart lock installations.\n\nIf you've **already purchased the lock**, typical installation pricing around Melbourne is often in the **A$150–A$300** range for a straightforward replacement, although more complex doors (mortise locks, drilling, or wiring) can cost more. Community reports for Maribyrnong smart lock installations fall within a similar range. [www.airtasker.com](https://www.airtasker.com/au/services/lock-installation/maribyrnong-vic/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nBefore booking, it's worth confirming:\n- The **brand and model** of your smart lock (e.g. Aqara, Yale, Lockly, Philips, Samsung).\n- Whether your door uses a **deadbolt** or **mortise lock**.\n- Whether any **door drilling or modifications** are required.\n\nIf you tell me the **smart lock model** and whether it's for a **house or apartment**, I can let you know if it's likely to fit your existing door and what installation should typically cost.",
